{% extends "templates/base.tmpl" %}
{% block title %}hTST Escape Rate Benchmark{% endblock %}
{% block content %}
<h2>hTST Escape Rate Benchmarks</h2>
hTST escape rate  benchmarks for single end point saddle searching algorithms.

<p>These benchmarks test the performances of single end point saddle searching 
algorithms of finding all the saddles below certain barrier height, or reaching 
99.9% of the true hTST rate assuming a constant prefactor of 1.2e+12 for each 
process. The maximum force on any atom has to be reduced to 0.001 eV/A for any 
successful searching. 

<h3><a id="Pt" href="#Pt">Heptamer Island on Pt(111) Surface</a></h3>

<p>All the 15 saddles below 1.3 eV are required to be found for this benchmark.  
The barrier heights are: 
[0.601, 0.601, 0.620, 0.986, 0.986, 0.987, 0.987, 0.989, 0.989, 1.196, 1.196, 1.196, 1.196, 1.207, 1.207]

<table class="sortable">
  <tr>
    <th>Algorithm</th>
    <th>Code</th>
    <th>Barrier_&lt;1.3eV Jobs;</th>
    <th>Barrier_&lt;1.3eV FCs;</th>
    <th>Rate_0.999 Jobs</th>
    <th>Rate_0.999 FCs</th>
    <th>Contributor</th>
  </tr>
  {% for entry in benchmarks['Pt']|sort(attribute='barrier_force_calls') %}
    <tr>
      <td>{{ entry.algorithm }}</td>
      <td>{{ entry.code }} </td>
      <td>{{ '%.0f' % entry.barrier_jobs }}</td>
      <td>{{ '%.3e' % entry.barrier_force_calls }}</td>
      <td>{{ '%.0f' % entry.rate_jobs }}</td>
      <td>{{ '%.3e' % entry.rate_force_calls }}</td>
      <td>{{ entry.contributor }}</td>
    </tr>
  {% endfor %}
</table>

<h3><a id="Al" href="#Al">Adatom on Al(100) Surface</a></h3>

<p>All the 8 saddles below 0.4 eV are required to be found for this benchmark.  
The barrier heights are: 
[0.233, 0.233, 0.233, 0.233, 0.372, 0.372, 0.372, 0.372]

<table class="sortable">
  <tr>
    <th>Algorithm</th>
    <th>Code</th>
    <th>Barrier_&lt;0.4eV Jobs;</th>
    <th>Barrier_&lt;0.4eV FCs;</th>
    <th>Rate_0.999 Jobs</th>
    <th>Rate_0.999 FCs</th>
    <th>Contributor</th>
  </tr>
  {% for entry in benchmarks['Al']|sort(attribute='barrier_force_calls') %}
    <tr>
      <td>{{ entry.algorithm }}</td>
      <td>{{ entry.code }} </td>
      <td>{{ '%.0f' % entry.barrier_jobs }}</td>
      <td>{{ '%.3e' % entry.barrier_force_calls }}</td>
      <td>{{ '%.0f' % entry.rate_jobs }}</td>
      <td>{{ '%.3e' % entry.rate_force_calls }}</td>
      <td>{{ entry.contributor }}</td>
    </tr>
  {% endfor %}
</table>


{% endblock %}
